### 1. GET /logs - Obtenir tots els logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Accept: application/json


### 2. GET /logs?nivell=ERROR - Filtrar logs per nivell de severitat (ERROR)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs?nivell=ERROR
Accept: application/json



### 3. POST /logs - Crear un nou log (Cas correcte -> 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nivell": "ERROR",
  "servei": "auth-service",
  "missatge": "Connexió rebutjada a la base de dades"
}



### 4. POST /logs - Crear log amb dades invàlides (Cas d'error -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nivell": "INVALID_LEVEL",
  "servei": "auth-service"
}
